---
// Edge-on side views, path-traced from the CAD (khensu-site/tools/shield/sideview.py, iPhone 18 Pro measured
// geometry): the phone standing upright seen exactly from the side, alone and with the shield, in the same
// orthographic frame, so the two images are at the same scale and the added thickness reads directly.
import sidev from '../../../public/khensu/shell/sidev.json';

const { width: W, height: H } = sidev;
---

<section class="section side" aria-labelledby="side-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Side view</p>
    <h2 id="side-title" class="big">Zero millimetres. <em>No new bump.</em></h2>
    <p class="lede">
      The shield covers the back and stops level with the lens tops, so it adds nothing above the camera. Its camera
      opening is angled so no lens, flash or sensor ever sees it, even the ultra wide at 120°. Inside that depth: a
      6.5 Wh battery, about five hours of relaying on its own cells.
    </p>
    <p class="lede">
      Each shield is CNC-machined from titanium for a precise fit, following the iPhone 18 Pro’s own edge curve, so
      the shield picks up where the phone’s edge leaves off. No step, no lip, one seamless shape.
    </p>

    <div class="views">
      {sidev.views.map((v) => (
        <figure class="view">
          <img src={v.src} alt={v.alt} width={W} height={H} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption>{v.label}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>

    <dl class="stats">
      <div><dt>0 mm</dt><dd>added above the lens tops, clear of every camera’s field of view.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="footnote">
      Path-traced to scale from the CAD model, on iPhone 18 Pro geometry measured from Apple’s published model; Apple’s
      accessory drawings take precedence when available. Relay time at about 1 W; battery life varies with use and settings. iPhone is a trademark of Apple Inc.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .views {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 2.5rem 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), transparent 70%);
  }
  .view {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .view img {
    display: block;
    height: clamp(380px, 72vh, 760px);
    width: auto;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    margin: 3rem 0 0;
  }
  .stats dt {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .stats dd {
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .footnote {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
